0..77 Comment "// A bracketed group inside a shell block runs its commands in a subshell, as"
78..151 Comment "// a command of its own, piped or nested. Every block but the last stands"
152..227 Comment "// before another root form, a stray refused where it stands; the last is a"
228..299 Comment "// definition\'s body, which the lowering admits no shell block for yet."
